  "confirmedConstraints": [
    "New games start at the Ashen Labyrinth gate camp. The 08 actor sources support compatibility and dedicated review scenes.",
    "Current visual priority is character/background/material coherence and scene-led whole-screen composition.",
    "Daily settlement and daily survival supply costs are removed. Each formal map attempt advances one day on success or failure; tutorial failures remain on day 1.",
    "Key journals use configured milestone conditions and prerequisite entries, record their actual trigger date, and appear once per campaign. Formal failure restores the existing initial loadout while preserving elapsed days and journal progress.",
    "Ashen Labyrinth uses entry tiers and per-turn stamina. Discoveries last for the current expedition. Each new departure restores starting health and creates a fresh starter deck. Stored supply cards and learned camp skills persist. Save decoding recognizes historical scenario IDs."
  ],
